Surface Pro 7 Rear Camera for Linux
===================================

This repository contains original integration code as well as patches
against several upstream projects. It is therefore a multi-license
repository.

Repository-authored integration code
------------------------------------

Except for files below patches/ and the third-party license texts under
LICENSES/, all repository-authored material in this repository, including
source code, scripts, configuration and documentation, is licensed under:

    SPDX-License-Identifier: GPL-2.0-or-later

See:

    LICENSES/GPL-2.0-or-later.txt

Upstream patches
----------------

Files below patches/ are source-code deltas against their respective
upstream projects. They remain subject to the license terms applicable
to the upstream files they modify.

In particular:

* patches/kernel/
  modifies Linux kernel source and follows the applicable Linux kernel
  licensing terms.

* patches/ipu4/
  modifies the pinned IPU4 source base and follows the applicable
  licensing terms of those upstream files.

* patches/libcamera/
  modifies libcamera source and follows the applicable libcamera
  licensing terms of those upstream files.

  The newly added ov8865.yaml contained in the libcamera patch carries
  its own:

      SPDX-License-Identifier: CC0-1.0

* patches/pipewire/
  modifies PipeWire source and follows the applicable licensing terms
  of those upstream files.

The presence of this top-level LICENSE file does not relicense upstream
code or patches derived from upstream code.

Upstream source revisions
-------------------------

The exact upstream repositories and revisions used by this project are
recorded in:

    docs/source-bases.txt

License texts
-------------

Relevant license texts are collected under LICENSES/ for convenience.
The SPDX identifiers and license notices in the respective upstream
source files remain authoritative for upstream-derived material.
